  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Phy 303.03 Re-Taking the National Physical Therapy Examination. Individuals seeking to retake the national physical therapy or physical therapy assistant examination shall register through the FSBPT.\n\nSource. #9430, eff 3-19-09; ss by #9653, eff 2-5-10; ss by #12087, eff 1-20-17 (formerly Phy 303.05); ss by #14563, eff 6-20-26, EXPIRES: 6-20-36",
